  - guid: e3670d64-2b9c-4fa2-96c8-e3d3338211e4
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Mmmm... Man!
      delaySeconds: 0.4
    editorPosition: {x: 260, y: 0}
  - guid: c5685f91-98a4-4665-9ee1-ec52936482ce
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: That is it!
      delaySeconds: 1.4
    editorPosition: {x: 520, y: 0}
  - guid: c74cecd3-1e47-4a98-90ee-4d07720e92aa
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Just like my mom used to make. Every night, when she got home from the noodle forge, I'd beg her to make this.
      delaySeconds: 1.4
    editorPosition: {x: 780, y: 0}
  - guid: 66c39338-7366-42a6-82c9-8df26b0cb7d4
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: She always brought the fresh stuff from work. The chili came from my uncle. He had an ancient plant he smuggled back in the day.
      delaySeconds: 4.9
    editorPosition: {x: 1040, y: 0}
  - guid: fd588189-2718-4a8a-b208-f11d3eb2c1f4
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Those were the days, man!
      delaySeconds: 5.6
    editorPosition: {x: 1300, y: 0}
  - guid: 0a0b8e0c-7caa-47b8-973a-60ec3086eb6d
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Wait...
      delaySeconds: 1.9
    editorPosition: {x: 1560, y: 0}
  - guid: 56f9d237-af7d-4a42-9d4e-6bb5fedfa7e2
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: My mom!
      delaySeconds: 1.2
    editorPosition: {x: 1820, y: 0}
  - guid: 25f0cb39-d3ee-4d97-858b-e69d11adc5f6
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Man, it's my mom!
      delaySeconds: 1.2
    editorPosition: {x: 2080, y: 0}
